  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At the front door, young Daisuke sees his father off to work and asks him to come home early. Muranishi claims he has overtime tonight, until sharp-eyed Mayumi spots arcade coins spilling out of his pocket. Listen to this morning send-off.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "daisuke",
      "t": "いってらっしゃい、パパ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "daisuke",
      "t": "早く帰ってね！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "今日は残業だから遅いんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mayumi",
      "t": "どうせゲームでもやってサボってるくせに。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そんなこと言うなよ、真由美。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mayumi",
      "t": "ほら！また小銭だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いや、これは仕事の小銭だよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mayumi",
      "t": "頑張って遊んできて。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "本当に仕事だからな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "じゃあ、行ってくる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "daisuke",
      "t": "いってらっしゃい！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "はーい。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Every Japanese home uses a matched pair of doorway greetings every morning. Let's hear how they work alongside Mayumi's teasing.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "daisuke",
      "t": "いってらっしゃい、パパ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have a good day, Papa.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "daisuke",
      "t": "早く帰ってね！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come home early, okay!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "今日は残業だから遅いんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have overtime today, so I will be late.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mayumi",
      "t": "どうせゲームでもやってサボってるくせに。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even though you are probably just playing games and slacking off anyway.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "そんなこと言うなよ、真由美。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not say things like that, Mayumi.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mayumi",
      "t": "ほら！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いや、これは仕事の小銭だよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, these are coins for work.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mayumi",
      "t": "頑張って遊んできて。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have fun playing hard out there.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "じゃあ、行ってくる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well then, I am heading out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "はーい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
